# operation_requirement_unsatisfied — unsatisfied operation requirements
# (README §7). Tests requirement checking.

OperationRequirementUnsatisfied is project
OperationRequirementUnsatisfied module examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied
OperationRequirementUnsatisfied target console
OperationRequirementUnsatisfied entry main

examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied is module
examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied path examples.operationRequirementUnsatisfied
examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied exports main
examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied purpose "Demonstrate requirement checking"
examplesOperationRequirementUnsatisfied invariant "Requirements are enforced"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main memory heap no
main async no
main purpose "Check operation requirements"
main invariant "Requirement checking works"

main let code immutable ExitCode 0
main return code
